er approval.\n\n- **Bug:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but FIN-212 and the docstring call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I checked the two test values by hand, and they match half-even.\n- **Change:** One line on branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, switching the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- **First PR attempt failed:** The branch was behind main, so I merged main into it. That moved the branch to 0a9452f727, so I re-ran CI on that commit.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0002 passed on 0a9452f727. The earlier run ci-0001 on 08d3cd5986 also passed, but that commit is no longer on the branch.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the two files and checking the repo layout.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019wcdbxCzHNdiGqZc5TTNuj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MuqX13Rar2L9yAYH7Qiqpd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01ELekFC8SwpfkNpU74E7Wem", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `round_money` uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but the docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I checked the test values by hand: 2.675 rounds to 2.68 and 2.665 rounds to 2.66 under half-even, so the test is correct. I'll create the branch and commit the one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017Eehx9qayVsVun15mLxKZm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"st